<title>AUSTRIA: ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM LEADING TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM LEADING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>KITZBUEHEL, Austria 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times after</p>
<p>the first run of a men's Alpine skiing World Cup slalom on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Thomas Sykora (Austria) 46.86 seconds</p>
<p>2. Mario Reiter (Austria) 47.03</p>
<p>3. Thomas Stangassinger (Austria) 47.05</p>
<p>4. Finn Christian Jagge (Norway) 47.12</p>
<p>5. Alberto Tomba (Italy) 47.56</p>
<p>6. Jure Kosir (Slovenia) 47.62</p>
<p>7. Martin Hansson (Sweden) 47.78</p>
<p>8. Andrej Miklavc (Slovenia) 47.86</p>
<p>9. Ole Christian Furuseth (Norway) 47.97</p>
<p>10. Kiminobu Kimura (Japan) 48.02</p>
</text>
